# Efficient generation

This repository is an **existing product**. Do not `build-farm` a new GitHub repo for work that belongs here.

- Have a `bc-` id → resume that Cloud Agent. Never start a parallel job.
- New fix → `@CloudAgents` in this project's `-fixbot` channel if wired, else a branch + PR. Composer 2.5, Fast off.
- Brand-new independent app (not this codebase) → `/Users/admin/Dev/YOLOProjects/cloud-agents` (`npm run build-farm` or `--engine hybrid`).

Never: Opus/GPT as the Cursor model, Fast on, `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` in the shell, extra Max usage, re-farming a failed `bc-` job.

## Close

Last lines of every job are COST: this run, this project total, today. If cents are unknown, write `COST this run: unknown`.
